# Tasks: tick with space (only that line of the note changes) and hide done tasks with H.
Output assets/readme/feature-tasks.gif
Source assets/readme/tapes/lib/common.tape

Type "2"
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 800ms
Space
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 600ms
Space
Sleep 1.5s
Type "H"
Sleep 2s
Type "H"
Sleep 1.5s

Type "q"
